    "4-3-3": {
      "status": "na",
      "reason": "Nothing in the pinned card pool moves more than one card out of the resource deck at a time, so this rule never changes what the engine does. Every placement from the resource deck is 'Place 1 (rested) Resource' (the resource step 7-4-1, GD01-107, GD01-025, GD05-106). Setup never moves resource-deck cards (6-2-1-3). No card text contains 'resource deck'. The only multi-resource effect is GD05-018 'Place 3 EX Resources', and it creates tokens instead of taking cards from the resource deck. So the 'simultaneous but physically one at a time' handling can never be triggered. Checked with a regex search over cards.ndjson ('place ([2-9]|two|three) ... Resource' / 'resource deck'): 1 hit, GD05-018. Re-test if a card that places several Resources from the resource deck is ever added."
    },
